<title>UK: Atel sets 200 mln SFR bond due 2009.</title>
<headline>Atel sets 200 mln SFR bond due 2009.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich</p>
<p> BORROWER   AARE-TESSIN AG FUER ELEKTRIZITAET</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    06.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  5</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
